flowchart LR

    %% =========================
    %% Import flow
    %% =========================

    A["1. Researcher uploads<br/>BibTeX / RIS"]
    B["2. Server-side parse<br/>Dedicated parsing library"]
    C["3. Validate + normalize<br/>Zod + DOI normalization"]
    D{"4. DOI syntactically valid?"}
    E["5. Deduplicate within uploaded file"]
    F["6. Persist references<br/>Partial success allowed"]

    A --> B --> C --> D
    D -->|Valid DOI| E
    D -->|No DOI| E
    D -->|Malformed DOI| E

    D -.-> INVALID["Malformed DOI<br/>Persist reference as unmonitored<br/>Set raw_doi_invalid = true<br/>Do not reject the whole row"]

    E -.-> DNOTE["Within-file dedupe happens during import.<br/><br/>Database also enforces permanent uniqueness<br/>for valid DOI references within the same paper:<br/><br/>UNIQUE(research_paper_id, normalized_doi)<br/>WHERE normalized_doi IS NOT NULL<br/><br/>A later upload to the same paper performs<br/>upsert / ignore rather than creating a duplicate."]

    E --> F
    F --> G{"7. Valid DOI present?"}

    G -->|Yes| H["8. Queue DOI resolution"]
    H --> I["9. Background worker<br/>Crossref REST API"]
    I --> J["10. Create / update<br/>ScholarlyWork metadata"]

    G -->|No| K["11. Keep reference unmonitored<br/>No supported identifier → no monitoring"]

    %% =========================
    %% Monitoring flow
    %% =========================

    L["12. Recurring monitoring trigger"]

    MC["MC — MonitoringCheck<br/><br/>One record per monitoring execution<br/>started • finished • status<br/>items checked • items flagged<br/>cursor_value = last_index_date"]

    CP["Read previous last_index_date<br/>from MonitoringCheck"]

    M["13. Fetch incremental delta<br/>Crossref Retraction Watch data<br/>from-index-date = last_index_date"]

    CURSOR["Runtime pagination only<br/>cursor=*<br/>Used inside this execution when needed<br/>Never persisted between runs"]

    N["14. Match delta vs local<br/>normalized DOI values"]
    O["15. Inspect matched events<br/>Check external event identity + provenance"]
    P{"16. New external event?"}

    Q["17. Create RetractionEvent<br/>Store source timestamp + provenance"]
    R["18. Determine affected papers<br/>and originating citations"]
    S["19. Create notification per<br/>researcher + event + paper"]
    T["Known event → idempotent no-op<br/>No duplicate notification"]

    L --> MC
    MC --> CP --> M
    M -.-> CURSOR
    M --> N --> O --> P
    P -->|Yes| Q --> R --> S
    P -->|No| T
    Q -.->|linked to execution when discovered by monitoring| MC

    UPDATE["20. On successful monitoring run<br/>persist latest successful last_index_date"]
    S --> UPDATE
    T --> UPDATE
    UPDATE --> MC

    MCNOTE["Checkpoint rule<br/><br/>Persist last_index_date as cursor_value.<br/>Use it as Crossref from-index-date on next run.<br/><br/>Crossref cursor=* is only request-level pagination.<br/>It is runtime-only and is not the checkpoint."]

    MC -.-> MCNOTE

    QNOTE["Notification rule<br/><br/>Idempotency boundary = researcher + event + paper.<br/><br/>Same event + same researcher + different papers<br/>→ separate notifications.<br/>Same event + same paper → one notification."]

    S -.-> QNOTE

    SOURCE["Source timestamp rule<br/><br/>Chronology uses the timestamp at the external source,<br/>not detection time or insertion time."]

    Q -.-> SOURCE

    %% =========================
    %% Resolution failure / retry
    %% =========================

    I -.-> HR["Resolution failure<br/>→ resolution_failed<br/>Retry with exponential backoff<br/>Maximum 5 attempts<br/>Then resolution_permanently_failed"]

    MANUAL["System-level admin manual verification<br/>Creates RetractionEvent with source = manual"]
    Q -.-> MANUAL

    %% =========================
    %% Monitoring failure
    %% =========================

    M -.-> LR["Monitoring/source failure<br/>→ execution failed or retry"]
    F -.-> ER["Row-level import failure<br/>does not roll back successful rows"]

    %% =========================
    %% Future boundary
    %% =========================

    FUTURE["Future / deferred<br/><br/>PaperAuthors • ORCID • ROR enrichment<br/>OpenAlex • DataCite • AuditLog<br/>additional identifiers • advanced notifications"]
    S -.-> FUTURE